VWL13 WL13 0 DC 0
VWL14 WL14 0 DC 0
VWL15 WL15 0 DC 0

* Unused write enables
VWE2 WE2 0 DC 0
VWE3 WE3 0 DC 0
VWE4 WE4 0 DC 0
VWE5 WE5 0 DC 0
